<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3-yr govt bond yield drops to 22.73 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3-yr govt bond yield drops to 22.73 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's three-year government bonds was set by auction at 22.73 percent, down from 22.99 percent at an auction on Sept 12, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday  HTBJ.		1999/D BOND</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     7,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     38,604.72 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,250 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,775 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  22.73 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		   98.81 pct</p>
</text>
